lls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing gameplay focused on patience and precision</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in music player for your own soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional egg skins to unlock and use</p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core Ultra 5 250K Plus<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050 Ti <br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Casual","Simulation"],"developers":["StationOfThoughts"],"publishers":["StationOfThoughts"],"release_date":"Sep 25, 2026"}